# INVWINMT.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the tool bar's
# buttons clicked with the driver's mouse lines.  New held down is drawn
# pressed, the bar holding the mouse; moved off it, raised; back on,
# pressed; released on it, the item form opens.  Open released off itself
# does nothing.  New held while DEL's question opens is let go, so its
# release after No does nothing; held while F5's reload keeps the frame
# busy, with no dialog, it is let go too.  A heading's click sorts the
# item list by maker.  On the tree a grayed button takes no press.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMT.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/mousechk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
M 218 DOWN BTN 0
S PRESSED
M 218 MOVE BTN 0 24 0
S AWAY
M 218 MOVE BTN 0
S BACKON
M 218 UP BTN 0
S NEWFORM
K ESC
S NEWESC
M 218 DOWN BTN 1
M 218 MOVE BTN 1 24 0
M 218 UP BTN 1 24 0
S OFFUP
M 218 DOWN BTN 0
K DEL
S DELASK
K N
M 218 UP BTN 0
S DELUP
M 218 DOWN BTN 0
K F5
S F5MOVE
M 218 UP BTN 0
S F5UP
K SHIFT-TAB
M 208 DOWN HEAD 2
M 208 UP HEAD 2
S BYMAKER
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 218 DOWN BTN 5
S GRAYDN
M 218 UP BTN 5
S GRAYUP
K ALT-F X
